      "lines": [
        "习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 计算从离地面 300 km 高的卫星能够看见地球表面的面积.",
        "答：$\\approx11.5\\times10^6\\ \\mathrm{km}^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 证明：球冠面积公式可写成 $S=\\pi(r^2+H^2)$，其中 $r$ 是底面半",
        "径，$H$ 是它的高."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 一平面把球的表面分成两部分，面积的比等于 $m:n$. 求这两部",
        "分体积的比.",
        "答：$\\frac{m^2(m+3n)}{n^2(n+3m)}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 已知球扇形的球冠部分的面积是 $S$，圆锥部分的面积为 $Q$. 求",
        "球扇形的体积.",
        "答：$\\frac{\\sqrt{S(4Q^2+S^2)}}{6\\sqrt{\\pi}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "韦尔提出的几何公理体系"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作为几何课程基础的公理体系，也可以与本书采用的公",
        "理体系不同. 其中的一种是在不定义的概念：“向量”，“点”，",
        "对应：“点对——向量”，以及向量的加法，数乘以向量和向量",
        "的数性积的基础上建立的公理体系. 并且向量、点及其运算",
        "满足下面各组公理."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第一组. 向量的加法公理"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任意两个向量 $\\vec{a}$、$\\vec{b}$ 都有唯一的一个向量与之对应，这个",
        "向量称为 $\\vec{a}$、$\\vec{b}$ 的和，记作 $\\vec{a}+\\vec{b}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\mathrm{I}_1$. 对于任意三个向量，有 $(\\vec{a}+\\vec{b})+\\vec{c}=\\vec{a}+(\\vec{b}+\\vec{c})$."
      ]
    },
